WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.340
Never, and I mean never, ask, how was your weekend?

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:06.740
How was your weekend?

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:08.000
How's the weather?

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:09.420
How's everything going?

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:13.080
I replaced scrolling with addictive communication skills

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:14.120
lessons for women.

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:16.920
Now, instead of wasting time on social media,

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:20.380
I spend 10 minutes a day improving my eloquence.

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:24.400
To start to speak like a high-value woman at work and anywhere,

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:27.440
express thoughts clearly and sound more confident.

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:35.020
This is the 14-day communication challenge built for those women who want to feel confident speaking at any age starts tomorrow.

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:38.160
Tap the screen to try micro-learning with SmartyMe.
